{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18208080","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18208080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:3:1820807001:":{"text":"안녕, 뮤리엘 할멈이 힐다의 옛 물건을 찾으라고 해서 왔어","source_cn":"你好，穆婆婆让我来找希尔达的旧物","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD4CE4F173B7F22F8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"안녕, 뮤리엘 할멈이 힐다의 옛 물건을 찾으라고 해서 왔어","female":"안녕, 뮤리엘 할멈이 힐다의 옛 물건을 찾으라고 해서 왔어","variant_male_record_index":"247079","variant_female_record_index":"247080","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1820807002:":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6FCAFD420F69F57","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... ","female":"... ","variant_male_record_index":"276155","variant_female_record_index":"274683","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1820807003:":{"text":"내 말이 안 들리나?","source_cn":"她听不到我说话？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70C0C59FA9956C34","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내 말이 안 들리나?","female":"내 말이 안 들리나?","variant_male_record_index":"247081","variant_female_record_index":"247082","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1820807004:":{"text":"썩 꺼져!","source_cn":"滚出去！<key:keyGender_dialog8001>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6017F2D169D073CF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"썩 꺼져!","female":"썩 꺼져!","variant_male_record_index":"247083","variant_female_record_index":"247084","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820808001:1":{"text":"썩 꺼져! 여긴 너 같은 그레이브본이 올 곳이 아니야. 게다가 산 자까지 데리고 와?","source_cn":"滚出去！这里不欢迎你——外来的亡灵，还带着生者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6CF2250EF490CE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1820808001":{"text":"썩 꺼져! 여긴 너 같은 그레이브본이 올 곳이 아니야. 게다가 산 자까지 데리고 와?","source_cn":"滚出去！这里不欢迎你——外来的亡灵，还带着生者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6CF2250EF490CE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820808002:1":{"text":"더 들어오면 너희 둘을 저주하겠어! 너희의 눈에는 탁한 물이 고일 것이고, 피부는 겹겹이 벗겨져 나갈 것이야!","source_cn":"再敢往深处走，我就诅咒你们两个！你们的眼睛将变成两团浑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A288B57344E77A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820808003:1":{"text":"반티스 군대의 저주는 그렇게 단순하지 않은 것으로 아는데.","source_cn":"据我所知，班题斯军队的诅咒方式不会这么轻易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D34C352E902EB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1820808003":{"text":"반티스 군대의 저주는 그렇게 단순하지 않은 것으로 아는데.","source_cn":"据我所知，班题斯军队的诅咒方式不会这么轻易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D34C352E902EB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820808004:1":{"text